<title>UK: Boots says extends chairman's term by a yr.</title>
<headline>Boots says extends chairman's term by a yr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Boots Company Plc said on Thursday it had extended the chairmanship of Michael Angus by another year to July 1998.  </p>
<p>The company has also created two new posts by appointing Steve Russell as managing director of Boots The Chemists and David Thompson as group finance director.</p>
<p>Russell continues to be responsible for Boots The Chemists and Boots Opticians and will take on board level responsibility for international retail development.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
